        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage BE375-CEN, Touchscreen Keypad Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Schlage Century Touchscreen Deadbolt is the next step in home security. This electronic touchscreen deadbolt can hold up to 19 different codes so that everyone can have their own. It is easy to program, ensuring that only the people who you want to have access to your home do. The Touchscreen Keypad Deadbolt features a modern appearance perfect for tech-lovers. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inches thick to 1-3/4 inches thick with backsets of either 2-3/4 inches or 2-3/8 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <b><a href=\"/products/thick-door-touchscreen-deadbolt-dbe375cen-02007\">Thick Door Touchscreen Century Deadbolt</a></b> for 2-1/2\" thick doors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Century Style Schlage Touch Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA Grade 2</li>\r\n<li>Fingerprint-resistant</li>\r\n<li>Works in the rain and when you’re wearing gloves.</li>\r\n<li>Stores up to 19 four-digit user codes.</li>\r\n<li>LED down lighting illuminates the keypad when needed.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install with just a screwdriver.</li>\r\n<li>3-Year electronics warranty.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime mechanical finish warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Schlage BE375 Century Keypad Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Height: 5.4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for 2-3/4\" or 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Battery: 2-year battery life with a 9V battery backup.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SCH-BE375-CEN-install-instructions.pdf?v=1704262321\"><b>Schlage BE375-CEN Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SCH-BE375-CEN-user-guide.pdf?v=1704262322\"><b>Schlage BE375-CEN User Guide (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
